.TH lprint-status 1 "LPrint" "2026-06-03" "Michael R Sweet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lprint-status \- show the current status of a printer
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lprint
.B status
[
.B \-d
.I PRINTER
] [
.B \-u
.I PRINTER-URI
]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command shows the current status of a printer.
If no printer is specified, the combined server state is shown.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
The following options are recognized by
.B lprint status:
.TP 5
\fB\-d \fIPRINTER\fR
Specifies the name of a printer.
.TP 5
\fB\-u \fIPRINTER-URI\fR
Specifies an "ipp:" or "ipps:" URI for a remote printer.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR lprint (1),
.BR lprint-default (1).
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Copyright \[co] 2019-2026 by Michael R Sweet.
